{"id":"1cd2a39dee160249","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-fixed-point-computation.md","title":"Fixed Point Computation Example","display":"ex-fixed-point-computation — Fixed Point Computation Example","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-fixed-point-computation","aliases":["89-ex-fixed-point-computation"],"display":"ex-fixed-point-computation — Fixed Point Computation Example","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-fixed-point-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-fixed-point-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-fixed-point-computation — Fixed Point Computation Example"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a74a9caa29e2a312\" href=\"?note=a74a9caa29e2a312\" title=\"89-thm-fixed-point-theorem\">89-thm-fixed-point-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(p)=\\Box p\">\\(A(p)=\\Box p\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)\\)</span> is the fixed-point set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\top\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)\n\\land\n(\\top\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\top\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)\n\\land\n(\\top\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 模态算子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> is a fixed point because necessitation yields <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\top\\in\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\Box\\top\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This avoids the false identification of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\Box\\bot\\)</span> with consistency.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-fixed-point-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"a74a9caa29e2a312","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A(p)=\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\top\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)\n\\land\n(\\top\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\top\\in\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":956,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["02536e2efd437c59","a74a9caa29e2a312","0006800fa1c85177"]}